    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prompt Marketplace Theme is designed to organize and display AI prompts in a structured and easy-to-navigate layout. It includes customizable homepage sections, category-based listings, search functionality, and responsive design for consistent viewing across devices. The theme supports featured prompt sections, content grids, call-to-action areas, and simple navigation menus that help visitors browse prompt collections efficiently. It is compatible with standard customization options, allowing changes to colors, typography, layouts, and branding elements without modifying core files. The theme also provides clean code, optimized page structure, and integration with commonly used plugins for added functionality. Built with a focus on usability, it offers organized content presentation while maintaining a straightforward interface. The overall design supports a clear content hierarchy, making it easier to manage prompt listings and related information. Regular customization options and responsive layouts help maintain a consistent browsing experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices."
    },
